<template>
  <section class="rag-page">
    <header class="page-head">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">EVALUATION / RETRIEVAL</span><h1>RAG 召回与上下文质量</h1><p>同时核对 Recall、Precision、动态 K、真实索引候选和 SQL Prompt 上下文预算。</p></div>
      <div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="button" @click="load">刷新</button><button class="btn primary" type="button" @click="copyCommand">复制评测命令</button></div>
